000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.    TUDCDOCK.
000400 AUTHOR.        BARBARA WINTER.
000500*INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR.
000600 DATE-WRITTEN.  JANUARY 1986.
000700 DATE-COMPILED.
000800*REMARKS.
000900*
001000*D   MENU PROGRAM FOR DOCK USERS.
001100*************************************************************
001200*************************************************************
001300***                     T U D C D O C K                   ***
001400***                                                       ***
001500***        THIS PROGRAM DISPLAYS THE MENU FOR DOCK USERS  ***
001600***      AT SIGN ON TIME.  ANY PROGRAM THE USER CAN       ***
001700***      EXECUTE IS CALLED FROM THIS PROGRAM.  ALL OTHER  ***
001800***      PROGRAMS HAVE BEEN CONVERTED INTO SUBROUTINES    ***
001900***      SO THAT THIS PROGRAM CAN CALL ALL OF THEM        ***
002000***      WITHOUT HAVING THE USER GET OUT OF THIS PROGRAM. ***
002100***      THIS SHOULD SPEED PROCESSING TIME BY ELIMINATING ***
002200***      DATABASE AND TERMINAL OPENS IN EACH PROGRAM.     ***
002300***                                                       ***
002400***   WARNING|||  THE SUBPROGRAM 'CSWITCHF' IS CALLED     ***
002500***     TO PERFORM ALL OPEN FORMFILE CALLS TO HANDLE      ***
002600***     VIEW ERRORS AND TO USE THE DL SIZE INTRINSIC. THIS***
002700***     IS DONE FOR THE FOLLOWING REASON:  DEPENDING ON   ***
002800***     THE ORDER OF PROGRAMS TO RUN THAT THE USER        ***
002900***     SELECTS, A PO VIEWFORM OR INQUIRY VIEW FORM OR    ***
003000***     DOCK VIEW FORM IS OPENED FIRST.  ONCE THE DOCK    ***
003100***     VIEW FORM IS OPENED FOR EXAMPLE, AND THEN THE PO  ***
003200***     VIEW FORM IS RETRIEVED, THERE IS NOT ENOUGH DL    ***
003300***     SIZE LEFT TO OPEN THE PO FORM - CAUSING THE       ***
003400***     PROGRAM TO ABORT.  USING THIS INTRINSIC BUILDS    ***
003500***     UP THE DLSIZE TO PREVENT THIS FROM HAPPENING.     ***
003600***                - BARBARA WINTER  MARCH 12, 1987       ***
003700*************************************************************
003800*************************************************************
003900*            TESCSEQ THAT CONTAINS THE NON-HP ESCAPE
004000*            SEQUENCES, IF ANY ARE USED.  THE NON-HP
004100*            SEQUENCES WILL OVERRIDE THE HP SEQUENCES.
004200*         3. THE ACTUAL PRINTING PROGRAM WILL GET THE
004300*            APPROPRIATE SEQUENCES PASSED DOWN TO IT
004400*            THRU THE INTERMEDIATE SUBROUTINES THAT
004500*            COPY ESC-NAME IN COPYLIB.
004600*
      *C***********************************************************
      *C  MAY 21, 1992  -  JEFF BUNGO    (005979)                 *
      *C       CHANGED THE PARAMETERS TO CALL SRCVEXEC AND SRSPRTS*
      *C       TO PASS IT PARAMETER BASE-MMISA, TO BE PASSED TO   *
      *C       CRSPRT SO THAT IT MAY ACCESS AN MMISA DATABASE FILE*
      *C       (PER-PERSONNEL).                                   *
      *C  SEPTEMBER 24, 1992 - JEFF BUNGO (006264)                *
      *C       ADDED A CALL TO MPLTINFO TO RETRIEVE P326 SWITCH   *
      *C       TO BE PASSED TO THE SUBROUTINES IN DOCKMISC.       *
      *C  JANUARY 08, 1993 - JEFF BUNGO (006343)                  *
      *C       ADDED Q8 AND Q9 TO THE DOCK MENU.                  *
      *C  AUGUST 13, 1993 - JEFF BUNGO (6413)                     *
      *C       ADDED VENDOR CODE INQUIRY (Q6) TO THE RECEIVING    *
      *C       DOCK MAIN MENU.                                    *
      *C  JANUARY 25, 1995 - JEFF BUNGO
      *C       PASS RAW MATERIAL GROUPS TO SRSPRTS TO DETIRMINE IF
      *C       A PO HAS RAW MATERIALS TO PRINT TO RAW MATERIAL
      *C       PRINTER
      *C
      *C  JUNE 23, 1995 - JEFF BUNGO
      *C       LOCK THE RD, RC, AND RC3 OPTIONS IF THE BATCH
      *C       ONLINE LOCK SWITCH IS SET IN OVSH (KELLY ONLY).
      *C
      *C  JUNE 6, 1996  - JEFF BUNGO
      *C       RETRIEVE THE SPECIAL PRINTING FLAG FROM OVSH AND
      *C       PLACE IN VARIABLE TO PASS TO SUBPROGRAMS.
      *C
      *C  APRIL 30, 1997 - JEFF BUNGO
      *C       PASS NEW PARAMETER TO SRCVEXEC (ASN-RECEIVER).
      *C       FROM THIS PROGRAM THE VALUE WILL BE SPACES AS
      *C       A DUMMY PARAMETER.
      *C
      *C  MAY 1, 1997 JEFF BUNGO
      *C       ADDED NEW KEY RS TO CALL TASNDOCK FOR ASN SHIPMENT
      *C       RECEIPT.
      *C
      *C  MAY 22, 2001  JE COFFMAN
      *C       ADDED LOGIC AT NAPANEE'S REQUEST TO PREVENT
      *C       UNAUTHORIZED USERS FROM VIEWING SENSITIVE
      *C       REQUISITION DATA.
      *C***********************************************************
