044600                              ESC-NAME
044700                              USER-AREA,
044800                              DIRDEL-AREA,
                                    AUTOSTORE-AREA,
044900                              LANGUAGE-PARMS
044910                              DOCK-OVERSHIPMENT
              END-IF
