061200************************************************************
061300*                    B L O W U P                           *
061400*     CHECK FOR IMAGE, VIEW, OR SPOOL ERROR.  CLOSE        *
061500*     FILES, GET OUT OF BLOCK MODE, AND DISPLAY            *
061600*     APPROPRIATE ERROR MESSAGE ON SCREEN.                 *
061700*                                                          *
061800*     ALSO APPENDS THE ERROR MESSAGE TO A FILE CALLED      *
061900*     BLOWUP.PUB.  TO READ THIS FILE, RUN "XBLPRT.OBJECT". *
062000*                                                          *
062100*         |||  PROGRAM IS ABORTED IN TBLOWUP  |||          *
062200************************************************************
062300 990-BLOWUP.
062400     MOVE "TUDCDOCK" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
062600     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
062700           VIEW-COMAREA, MPLTINFO-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
062800           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
           GOBACK.
062900 999-EXIT.  EXIT.
